  "description": "Pink marble underfoot, dulled to the colour of old soap. The reception desk faces the street door under five clocks stopped at the same minute, a key on every hook behind it, and EMBASSY glowing over the lot. The stairs climb inside a wall down the middle of the room. Past it, Lowry's bar runs along the east wall under COCKTAILS in pink neon, and a card table sits under a green lamp with a television high on the wall where every seat can see it. A leather sofa and two wing chairs sit on a worn rug by the door. The lamps are low. Everything is dusted. Nothing is fixed.",
